<title>UK: Kansai Airport sets $200 mln 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Kansai Airport sets $200 mln 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KANSAI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    02.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.23     PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.23     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.JUL.06 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
